  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indini Cereal Producers Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to build the capacity of the organization by providing training for members in cooperative management; marketing; storage techniques; and improved production methods. Funds will also be used to purchase farming tools; establish a revolving fund and hire qualified staff.</narrative>
  </description>
